# Keep local secrets and keys out of every build context. bin/self-deploy.sh
# already ships only `git archive HEAD`; this is the second line of defence.
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem

# Host build output and dependencies: a `docker compose build` from a developer
# checkout must not copy them over what the deps and builder stages produce.
# Every COPY source in docker/web.Dockerfile stays in the context
# (apps/web/src/lib/__tests__/dockerignore-copy-sources.test.ts).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
